<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Forterre et al. (2005) Nature Doubly-Curved Shallow Shell Elastic Energy & Saddle-Node Cusp Catastrophe in Dionaea muscipula (Dionaea muscipula (Venus flytrap bilobed leaf trap))",
        "Forterre et al. (2005) Nature Doubly-Curved Shallow Shell Elastic Energy & Saddle-Node Cusp Catastrophe in Dionaea muscipula faithfully reproduces Dionaea muscipula (Venus flytrap bilobed leaf trap) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-1>,
