<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Forterre et al. (2005) Nature Doubly-Curved Shallow Shell Elastic Energy & Saddle-Node Cusp Catastrophe in Dionaea muscipula — Model fidelity to source: 95/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Implements the doubly-curved shallow shell stretching + bending energy U(kappa_x, kappa_y) (`doubly_curved_shell_energy`, L164-179), Gaussian curvature stretching penalty U_stretch = c_stretch*alpha*(kappa_x*kappa_y - k_init^2)^2 (`gauss_stretching_energy`, L151-161), L-BFGS-B 2D equilibrium solver (`relax_shell_equilibrium_2d`, L193-235), cusp catastrophe fold metrics (`compute_cusp_bifurcation_metrics`, L238-262), and coupled 2D RK45 poroelastic + inertial snap dynamics (`simulate_coupled_snap_dynamics`, L266-337), backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_066_venus_flytrap_snap_buckling.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.5e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Forterre et al. (2005) Nature Doubly-Curved Shallow Shell Elastic Energy & Saddle-Node Cusp Catastrophe in Dionaea muscipula — Morphometric validation: 95/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L1021-1122) computes 9 reference-anchored morphometric measurements with statistical tests: critical cusp threshold alpha_c = 0.8000 (ref 0.8000), flat-pass Gaussian stretching barrier U_stretch(0,0) = 4.8000 (ref 4.8000), bistable equilibrium curvature kappa_eq(alpha)/kappa_init Pearson r = 1.0000 (RMSE = 0.0000), saddle-node fold locus kx0_fold(alpha)/kappa_init Pearson r = 1.0000 (RMSE = 0.0000), coupled 2D snap peak speed Pearson r = 1.0000 (RMSE = 0.0003 s^-1), three-stage closure trajectory kappa_x(t)/kappa_init Pearson r = 1.0000 (RMSE = 0.0000), surgical strip ablation barrier Delta_U(L/3) = 0.000000 (ref 0.0), specimen bilateral lobe symmetry = 0.9745, and marginal cilia tooth spacing CV = 0.3905." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-bistable-equilibrium-curvature-kappa-eq-alpha-kappa-init-correlation-across-alpha-in-0-2-5-0>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-coupled-2d-snap-peak-speed-correlation-across-alpha-in-0-2-5-0>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-cusp-catastrophe-saddle-node-fold-locus-kx0-fold-alpha-kappa-init-correlation-across-alpha-in-0-2-5-0>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-dionaea-muscipula-specimen-bilateral-lobe-symmetry-index-across-central-midrib-dionaea-muscipula-trap-lobe-specimen-jpg>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-dionaea-muscipula-specimen-marginal-cilia-tooth-angular-spacing-cv-dionaea-muscipula-trap-lobe-specimen-jpg>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-flat-pass-gaussian-stretching-energy-barrier-u-stretch-0-0-at-adult-alpha-3-0>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-forterre-et-al-2005-critical-cusp-catastrophe-coupling-threshold-alpha-c-nu-0-28>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-surgical-curvature-relief-strip-ablation-energy-barrier-delta-u-l-eff-l-3>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-three-stage-closure-kinematics-trajectory-kappa-x-t-kappa-init-correlation-alpha-3-0>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-morphometric-validation-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.5e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Forterre et al. (2005) Nature Doubly-Curved Shallow Shell Elastic Energy & Saddle-Node Cusp Catastrophe in Dionaea muscipula — MorphoEval overall 94.0/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 (v2) evaluation of `2005-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling.py` (overall weighted score: 94.1/100, up from 56.4/100 in v1). The remediated script minimizes the 2D doubly-curved shallow shell elastic energy U(kappa_x, kappa_y) via L-BFGS-B relaxation and integrates the coupled 2D poroelastic + inertial snap dynamics across alpha in [0.2, 5.0]; reproduces the cusp catastrophe threshold alpha_c = 0.8000, saddle-node fold locus (r = 1.0000), and three-stage closure kinematics (tau_snap = 56.0 ms vs poroelastic hydraulic limit tau_p = 2.53 s, r_kx = 1.0000); validates quartic leaf-size scaling and surgical curvature-relief strip cutting ablation (L_eff = L/3 -> alpha = 0.037 < alpha_c, barrier = 0.0); and segments the SHA-256-locked Dionaea muscipula specimen image (bilateral symmetry = 0.9745, 15 marginal cilia teeth). Overall 94.0/100 (faithfulness 93.8, reproducibility 94.3); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 95, Morphological realism / specimen match 92, Parameter expressivity 94, Morphometric validation 95, Source and data traceability 95, Code-to-model traceability 94, Reproducibility package 94. Output judged: docs/media/venus_flytrap_snap_buckling_comparison.png: rendered output of 2005-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling.py at 8871db0, image/png, 1375264 B, 2682×1653 px, artifact_sha256 d3f5e5d058cf4b04e7250ea4a7c0b223d472b2731048bd90b9ce3fdce46823be (sha256 d3f5e5d058cf4b04e7250ea4a7c0b223d472b2731048bd90b9ce3fdce46823be), spec_fingerprint 09b1066fde1900adefad4e5592cdbc34803c6f1439dd9667ec1014d5137d4133. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 09b1066fde1900adefad4e5592cdbc34803c6f1439dd9667ec1014d5137d4133; artifact_sha256: d3f5e5d058cf4b04e7250ea4a7c0b223d472b2731048bd90b9ce3fdce46823be; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/venus_flytrap_snap_buckling/dionaea_muscipula_trap_lobe_specimen.jpg=f2738290d66e4418..., datasets/venus_flytrap_snap_buckling/paper_citations.bib=f6ac2d52597b043c..., datasets/venus_flytrap_snap_buckling/scout_manifest.json=572531a0986c798e..., datasets/venus_flytrap_snap_buckling/venus_flytrap_snap_buckling_reference.json=593d9449e870fcf2...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-audit." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the doubly-curved shallow shell snap-buckling dynamics to a spatially resolved finite-element model of trigger hair mechanosensitive ion-channel action potential propagation across the lobe." ;
    pk:hasScore 9.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

